atom     containers/slip-flattens
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      [|{X}].elems  ===  ({X}).elems
why      an explicit slip flattens regardless of the one-argument rule
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:slip-flattens
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); [|1].elems }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); (1).elems }

